{"4165530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Imperfections", "steam_appid": 4165530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imperfections is a 2D space shooter, where you build your own battleship, manage energy and heat to fight off enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/a77402d115446f7c38a42d36d2119482.poster.avif?t=1766077706\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/a77402d115446f7c38a42d36d2119482.webm?t=1766077706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/a77402d115446f7c38a42d36d2119482.mp4?t=1766077706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use various parts to build your spaceship including thrusters, turrets, shockwaves and more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/cdbd790e88da57f967f243166e983e67.poster.avif?t=1766077706\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/cdbd790e88da57f967f243166e983e67.webm?t=1766077706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/cdbd790e88da57f967f243166e983e67.mp4?t=1766077706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also need to be careful and build your ship wisely as it can overheat or parts may function differently depending on where you place them. For example if you place your thruster on the side, your ship will rotate like in the real world!<br>You can unlock many central room types that modify your survival experience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/9c183dfe12f6c2ecd43d486e5c0c7bab.poster.avif?t=1766077706\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/9c183dfe12f6c2ecd43d486e5c0c7bab.webm?t=1766077706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/9c183dfe12f6c2ecd43d486e5c0c7bab.mp4?t=1766077706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each electrical part uses energy and produces heat on use, you need to manage your temperature using coolers or you can overheat and explode! You also need to manage energy as without it, none of your parts would work! You can generate energy using solar panels or heat recyclers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different enemies and bosses that will try to take you down. They can be ranged, melee or even mixed! Each boss has their own unique abilities that will test your ship in different aspects from movement to firepower! There are also different enemy types that make your experience much more thrilling!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imperfections is a 2D space shooter, where you build your own battleship, manage energy and heat to fight off enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/a77402d115446f7c38a42d36d2119482.poster.avif?t=1766077706\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/a77402d115446f7c38a42d36d2119482.webm?t=1766077706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/a77402d115446f7c38a42d36d2119482.mp4?t=1766077706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use various parts to build your spaceship including thrusters, turrets, shockwaves and more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/cdbd790e88da57f967f243166e983e67.poster.avif?t=1766077706\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/cdbd790e88da57f967f243166e983e67.webm?t=1766077706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/cdbd790e88da57f967f243166e983e67.mp4?t=1766077706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also need to be careful and build your ship wisely as it can overheat or parts may function differently depending on where you place them. For example if you place your thruster on the side, your ship will rotate like in the real world!<br>You can unlock many central room types that modify your survival experience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/9c183dfe12f6c2ecd43d486e5c0c7bab.poster.avif?t=1766077706\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/9c183dfe12f6c2ecd43d486e5c0c7bab.webm?t=1766077706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/extras/9c183dfe12f6c2ecd43d486e5c0c7bab.mp4?t=1766077706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each electrical part uses energy and produces heat on use, you need to manage your temperature using coolers or you can overheat and explode! You also need to manage energy as without it, none of your parts would work! You can generate energy using solar panels or heat recyclers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different enemies and bosses that will try to take you down. They can be ranged, melee or even mixed! Each boss has their own unique abilities that will test your ship in different aspects from movement to firepower! There are also different enemy types that make your experience much more thrilling!</p>", "short_description": "Imperfections is a 2D space shooter, where you build your own battleship, manage energy and heat to fight off enemies and bosses.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/01ef27ef0a0d443a725da3ea97fbdb6b958acd93/header.jpg?t=1766077706", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/876336114dd8ba6452c4200fbc3755ab1ec6bf71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766077706", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165530/876336114dd8ba6452c4200fbc3755ab1ec6bf71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766077706", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 G